lm in crises.\n**What would change my vote:** Positive confirmation that B has good crew\u2011communication skills would solidify his lead. Conversely, evidence that B\u2019s communication is poor would push me toward Candidate\u202fC (if his communication were shown adequate) or force a re\u2011evaluation of A or D if they demonstrate stress handling and calmness.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_1\", \"vote\": \"Candidate B\"}"}
