u2011communication skills would solidify his lead. Conversely, evidence that his communication is poor would shift preference toward Candidate\u202fC (if his communication were shown adequate) or force a re\u2011evaluation of A or D if they demonstrate stress handling and calmness.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate B\"}"}
